      "html": "\n<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#f8fafc] text-[#1f2328] font-sans\" data-kid=\"0\">\n  \n  <header class=\"h-14 bg-white border-b border-[#e2e8f0] flex items-center justify-between px-6 sticky top-0 z-20\" data-kid=\"1\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"3\">\n        <span class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-[#c8102e] rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs italic\" data-kid=\"4\">IELTS</span>\n        <h1 class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase\" data-kid=\"5\">Creator Panel</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"h-4 w-px bg-[#e2e8f0]\" data-kid=\"6\"></div>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"7\">Drafting: <span class=\"font-medium text-[#1f2328]\" data-kid=\"8\">Reading Practice Test 1</span></p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"9\">\n      <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0969da] border border-[#0969da] rounded-md hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"10\">Preview Test</button>\n      <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-[#0969da] rounded-md shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"11\">Publish Test</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"flex h-[calc(100vh-3.5rem)] overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"12\">\n    \n    <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto bg-white border-r border-[#e2e8f0] relative\" data-kid=\"13\">\n      \n      <div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md px-8 py-3 border-b border-[#f1f5f9] flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"14\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 bg-[#f1f5f9] p-1 rounded-lg\" data-kid=\"15\">\n          <button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#1f2328] hover:bg-white rounded-md transition-all\" data-kid=\"16\">\n            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#0969da]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"17\"></svg>\n            Add Section\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#1f2328] hover:bg-white rounded-md transition-all\" data-kid=\"19\">\n            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"20\"></svg>\n            Split\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" data-kid=\"22\">\n          <button class=\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 rounded-md hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors\" title=\"Manage Parts\" data-kid=\"23\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"24\"></svg>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-red-600 rounded-md hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors\" title=\"Remove Part\" data-kid=\"26\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"27\"></svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto py-12 px-8\" data-kid=\"29\">\n        \n        <div class=\"group relative mb-8\" data-kid=\"30\">\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"The Evolution of Modern Architecture\" class=\"w-full text-3xl font-bold text-[#1f2328] border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 hover:bg-slate-50 rounded transition-colors placeholder:text-slate-300\" placeholder=\"Passage Title\" data-kid=\"31\">\n          <div class=\"absolute -left-32 top-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"32\">Passage Title</div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"group relative mb-12\" data-kid=\"33\">\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"A survey of industrial influences in 20th century design\" class=\"w-full text-lg text-slate-500 italic border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 hover:bg-slate-50 rounded transition-colors placeholder:text-slate-300\" placeholder=\"Optional Subtitle\" data-kid=\"34\">\n          <div class=\"absolute -left-32 top-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"35\">Subtitle</div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"space-y-12\" data-kid=\"36\">\n          \n          <div class=\"relative group\" data-kid=\"37\">\n            \n            <div class=\"absolute -left-12 top-0 flex flex-col items-center\" data-kid=\"38\">\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 font-bold text-sm border-2 border-transparent group-focus-within:border-[#0969da] group-focus-within:bg-blue-50 group-focus-within:text-[#0969da] transition-all\" data-kid=\"39\">A</span>\n              <div class=\"w-0.5 h-full bg-slate-50 absolute top-8 -bottom-12 -z-10\" data-kid=\"40\"></div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"41\">\n              <textarea class=\"w-full min-h-[120px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-700 border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 resize-none overflow-hidden hover:bg-slate-50/50 rounded transition-colors\" oninput=\"this.style.height = &quot;&quot;;this.style.height = this.scrollHeight + &quot;px&quot;\" data-kid=\"42\">Architecture has always been a reflection of the society that creates it. In the early 20th century, the rapid industrialization of Western nations demanded a new approach to building—one that prioritized function over form and efficiency over ornament. This shift was most notably championed by the Bauhaus school in Germany, which sought to bridge the gap between craftsmanship and industrial production.</textarea>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            \n            <div class=\"absolute -right-12 top-0 flex flex-col gap-1 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"43\">\n               <button class=\"p-2 text-[#0969da] bg-blue-50 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-blue-100 transition-all hover:bg-blue-100\" title=\"Toggle Label\" data-kid=\"44\">\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"18\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9.568 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25v4.318c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591l9.581 9.581a2.25 2.25 0 003.182 0l4.318-4.318a2.25 2.25 0 000-3.182L11.159 3.659A2.25 2.25 0 009.568 3z\" data-kid=\"21\"></path><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 6h.008v.008H6V6z\" data-kid=\"25\"></path></svg>\n               </button>\n               <button class=\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-red-500 hover:bg-red-50 rounded-lg transition-all\" title=\"Remove Section\" data-kid=\"47\">\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"28\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16\" data-kid=\"45\"></path></svg>\n               </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"relative group\" data-kid=\"50\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-12 top-0 flex flex-col items-center\" data-kid=\"51\">\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-50 text-slate-200 font-bold text-sm border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 transition-all\" data-kid=\"52\">?</span>\n              <div class=\"w-0.5 h-full bg-slate-50 absolute top-8 -bottom-12 -z-10\" data-kid=\"53\"></div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"54\">\n              <textarea class=\"w-full min-h-[120px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400 border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 resize-none overflow-hidden hover:bg-slate-50/50 rounded transition-colors italic\" oninput=\"this.style.height = &quot;&quot;;this.style.height = this.scrollHeight + &quot;px&quot;\" data-kid=\"55\">This is an unlabelled paragraph. It won't be indexed for tasks like Matching Headings or Paragraph Information unless a label is assigned. You can toggle labels using the tag icon in the side menu.</textarea>\n            </div>\n            \n             \n             <div class=\"absolute -right-12 top-0 flex flex-col gap-1 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"56\">\n               <button class=\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-[#0969da] hover:bg-blue-50 rounded-lg transition-all\" title=\"Toggle Label\" data-kid=\"57\">\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"46\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9.568 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25v4.318c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591l9.581 9.581a2.25 2.25 0 003.182 0l4.318-4.318a2.25 2.25 0 000-3.182L11.159 3.659A2.25 2.25 0 009.568 3z\" data-kid=\"48\"></path><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 6h.008v.008H6V6z\" data-kid=\"49\"></path></svg>\n               </button>\n               <button class=\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-red-500 hover:bg-red-50 rounded-lg transition-all\" title=\"Remove Section\" data-kid=\"60\">\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"58\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16\" data-kid=\"59\"></path></svg>\n               </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"relative group py-4\" data-kid=\"63\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-12 top-4 flex flex-col items-center\" data-kid=\"64\">\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-50 text-slate-300 font-bold text-sm border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200\" data-kid=\"65\">C</span>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"w-full text-left px-4 py-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-slate-100 text-slate-400 hover:border-[#0969da] hover:bg-blue-50/30 hover:text-[#0969da] transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group/btn\" data-kid=\"66\">\n               <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 group-hover/btn:scale-110 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"67\"></svg>\n               <span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"69\">Click to add Section C</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"w-[480px] bg-[#f8fafc] overflow-y-auto border-l border-[#e2e8f0]\" data-kid=\"70\">\n      <div class=\"p-8\" data-kid=\"71\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\" data-kid=\"72\">\n          <div data-kid=\"73\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1f2328] flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"74\">\n              <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#0969da]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"75\"></svg>\n              Question Builder\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-medium italic\" data-kid=\"77\">1 Active Set</p>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:border-[#0969da] text-[#0969da] transition-all\" data-kid=\"78\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"79\"></svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"81\">\n          <div class=\"bg-[#f1f5f9] px-5 py-3 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200\" data-kid=\"82\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"83\">\n              <span class=\"bg-[#0969da] text-white text-[10px] font-black px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"84\">Q1-Q5</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"85\">Heading Match</span>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-red-500 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"86\">\n              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"87\"></svg>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"p-6 space-y-8\" data-kid=\"89\">\n            \n            <div data-kid=\"90\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\" data-kid=\"91\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"92\">List of Headings</h4>\n                <button class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[#0969da] hover:underline\" data-kid=\"93\">+ Add Heading</button>\n              </div>\n              \n              <div class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"94\">\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 group/heading\" data-kid=\"95\">\n                  <span class=\"min-w-[28px] text-right font-serif text-slate-400 font-bold italic pt-1\" data-kid=\"96\">i</span>\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 bg-slate-50 border border-transparent group-hover/heading:border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2 transition-all\" data-kid=\"97\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" value=\"The socio-political impact of transparency\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 text-sm text-slate-700\" data-kid=\"98\">\n                  </div>\n                  <button class=\"p-2 text-slate-300 hover:text-red-400 opacity-0 group-hover/heading:opacity-100 transition-all\" data-kid=\"99\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"100\"></svg>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 group/heading\" data-kid=\"102\">\n                  <span class=\"min-w-[28px] text-right font-serif text-slate-400 font-bold italic pt-1\" data-kid=\"103\">ii</span>\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 bg-slate-50 border border-transparent group-hover/heading:border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2 transition-all\" data-kid=\"104\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" value=\"The transition to functionalism\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 text-sm text-slate-700\" data-kid=\"105\">\n                  </div>\n                  <button class=\"p-2 text-slate-300 hover:text-red-400 opacity-0 group-hover/heading:opacity-100 transition-all\" data-kid=\"106\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"107\"></svg>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 group/heading\" data-kid=\"109\">\n                  <span class=\"min-w-[28px] text-right font-serif text-slate-400 font-bold italic pt-1\" data-kid=\"110\">iii</span>\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 bg-slate-50 border border-transparent group-hover/heading:border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2 transition-all\" data-kid=\"111\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" value=\"A comparison of materials\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 text-sm text-slate-700\" data-kid=\"112\">\n                  </div>\n                  <button class=\"p-2 text-slate-300 hover:text-red-400 opacity-0 group-hover/heading:opacity-100 transition-all\" data-kid=\"113\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"114\"></svg>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div data-kid=\"116\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\" data-kid=\"117\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"118\">Question → Section Mapping</h4>\n                <button class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[#0969da] hover:underline\" data-kid=\"119\">+ Add Link</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"120\">\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-slate-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100\" data-kid=\"121\">\n                  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\" data-kid=\"122\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\" data-kid=\"123\">Quest.</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-black text-[#1f2328]\" data-kid=\"124\">01</span>\n                  </div>\n                  \n                  <div class=\"flex-1 flex justify-center\" data-kid=\"125\">\n                    <div class=\"h-0.5 flex-1 bg-slate-200 relative\" data-kid=\"126\">\n                       <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0969da]/20 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"127\"></div>\n                       <div class=\"absolute right-0 -top-[3px] w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#0969da]\" data-kid=\"128\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end\" data-kid=\"129\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\" data-kid=\"130\">Section</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-1 mt-1\" data-kid=\"131\">\n                      <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold border-2 transition-all border-[#0969da] bg-blue-50 text-[#0969da]\" data-kid=\"132\">A</button>\n                      <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold border-2 transition-all border-transparent text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100\" data-kid=\"133\">B</button>\n                      <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold border-2 transition-all border-transparent text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100\" data-kid=\"134\">C</button>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-slate-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100\" data-kid=\"135\">\n                  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\" data-kid=\"136\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\" data-kid=\"137\">Quest.</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-black text-[#1f2328]\" data-kid=\"138\">02</span>\n                  </div>\n                  \n                  <div class=\"flex-1 flex justify-center\" data-kid=\"139\">\n                    <div class=\"h-0.5 flex-1 bg-slate-200 relative\" data-kid=\"140\">\n                       <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0969da]/20 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"141\"></div>\n                       <div class=\"absolute right-0 -top-[3px] w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#0969da]\" data-kid=\"142\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end\" data-kid=\"143\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\" data-kid=\"144\">Section</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-1 mt-1\" data-kid=\"145\">\n                      <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold border-2 transition-all border-transparent text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100\" data-kid=\"146\">A</button>\n                      <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold border-2 transition-all border-[#0969da] bg-blue-50 text-[#0969da]\" data-kid=\"147\">B</button>\n                      <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold border-2 transition-all border-transparent text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100\" data-kid=\"148\">C</button>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"px-6 py-4 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-200\" data-kid=\"149\">\n             <button class=\"w-full py-3 bg-white border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-slate-400 text-sm font-bold hover:border-[#0969da] hover:text-[#0969da] hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"150\">\n                <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-kid=\"151\"></svg>\n                Add Another Question Set\n             </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
